  "longBusinessSummary": "EDAG Engineering Group AG engages in the development of vehicles, derivatives, modules, and production facilities for the automotive and commercial vehicle industries worldwide. The company operates through three segments: Vehicle Engineering, Electrics/Electronics, and Production Solutions segments. The Vehicle Engineering segment offers vehicle development services, including package and ergonomics, body assembly, surface design, and interior and exterior development services; vehicle integration services; test vehicles, sub-assemblies, vehicle bodies, and individual vehicle conversions; hydrogen storage systems; project management; and after sales services. Its Electrics/Electronics segment is involved in the development of electrical and electronic systems and functions; integration and validation; development of hardware and software components; and process and data management. The Production Solutions segment engages in automotive solutions comprising planning and virtual commissioning; industrial solutions, such as the development of production solutions; and smart city solutions. It serves automotive and bikes, commercial and off-road-vehicles, defense, medical and pharma, energy, and industrial sectors. The company was founded in 1969 and is based in Arbon, Switzerland. EDAG Engineering Group AG operates as a subsidiary of Aton Austria Holding GmbH.",
